[31.015496, "o", "Help on class _PrintSinkPartition in module bytewax.connectors.stdio:\r\n\r\nclass _PrintSinkPartition(bytewax.outputs.StatelessSinkPartition)\r\n |  Method resolution order:\r\n |      _PrintSinkPartition\r\n |      bytewax.outputs.StatelessSinkPartition\r\n |      abc.ABC\r\n |      typing.Generic\r\n |      builtins.object\r\n |\r\n |  Methods defined here:\r\n |\r\n |  write_batch(self, items: List[Any]) -> None\r\n |      Write a batch of output items.\r\n |\r\n |      Called multiple times whenever new items are seen at this\r\n |      point in the dataflow.\r\n |\r\n |      :arg items: Items in the dataflow. Non-deterministically\r\n |          batched.\r\n |\r\n |  ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n |  Data and other attributes defined here:\r\n |\r\n |  __abstractmethods__ = frozenset()\r\n |\r\n |  __orig_bases__ = (bytewax.outputs.StatelessSinkPartition[typing.Any],)\r\n |\r\n |  __parameters__ = ()\r\n |\r\n |  ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n |  Methods inherited from bytewax.outputs.StatelessSinkPartition:\r\n |\r\n |  close(self) -> None\r\n |      Cleanup this partition when the dataflow completes.\r\n |\r\n |      This is not guaranteed to be called. It will only be called\r\n |      when the dataflow finishes on finite input. It will not be\r\n |      called during an abrupt or abort shutdown.\r\n |\r\n"]
